WEBVTT

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.780
K... Kamimura!

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:38.640
Hey!

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.250
V... Vampire?!

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:05.470
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.800
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:14.850
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:22.460
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:26.520
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:33.360
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:38.660
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.110
No one knows her true face.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.570
They said that all the blood
was drained from her body!

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.070
- Oh, no!
- Scary!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.840
I'm frightened to walk through that
park on my way home now.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.610
They don't get it at all.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.450
It's the work of a vampire.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.080
I know because I met her.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.920
We have a new student.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:30.820
You, come in.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.790
I'm Miyu...

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.200
Yamano.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.800
Anyway, take a seat.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.270
Let me see... yes, right over there.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:45.570
Machiyama!

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:46.600
Y... yes sir.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.140
You can sit next to him.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.480
How do you do?

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.450
What are you nervous for,
Machiyama?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.610
The nerd boy can't
say hi to a real girl?

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.290
Is this for real?

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:14.190
"I contemplate, the evil creed
of the coming era...

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.600
the magic of the Christian God,
the kapitan of the black ship."

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:18.540
This "kapitan" means...

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.580
It means captain in Portuguese.
Right, Miss Maiko?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:26.740
It's equivalent to captain in English
but rather than translating it to...

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.870
Yes, you're right.
May I proceed?

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.480
Oh yes, yes please.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.030
What's this?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.590
Just a note.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:53.430
Just? Well quit it!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.170
Sorry ma'am.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.340
Three minutes left.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.180
If you have time, look over
your answers one last time.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.240
Yearbooks?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.710
Anything specific you want to know?

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:35.570
Miss Yanagihara, she graduated
from this school, didn't she?

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.280
Yes, as one of the top literary
students in the Nation.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:41.720
She even has a Masters Degree, but for
family reasons she became a teacher.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.020
I also know why.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.260
You know a lot about her,
don't you?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:49.350
Miss Maiko is the only one
who I can talk to as an equal...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.230
so I snooped around.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.100
I think a person should investigate
anything that looks interesting.

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:55.190
These books are interesting, too.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.010
The school has books on vampires?

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.800
I requested them,
of course I also have some.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.700
So, you're interested in legends?

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.750
I'm interested in reality.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.110
I've seen one.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.610
Probably just a dream or something.

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:18.960
You play tough, eh?

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.030
Sorry, I'm late.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:28.930
I had to attend another meeting.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.160
They think holding a meeting
is all they need to do.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.570
Aren't you hungry?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.100
I've run out... of energy.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.940
After all, you're the
only friend I have.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:49.050
Teachers cannot be trusted.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.680
And students are...

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.790
Yes, they did it again.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.040
Miss Yanagihara, you're just like us.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.160
They enjoy watching me in pain.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.330
I've had enough.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.330
What should I do?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.570
If they reveal that...

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.730
Even if I'm not punished,
how would people look at me?!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.170
This is too unbearable!

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.580
I wish all those girls were...

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:48.410
No.

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:50.910
I just don't want
them to say anything.

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:53.220
That's all.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.790
But you beeped me.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:03.830
You sure did!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.400
It said we're gonna
investigate Yoko.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:07.500
Huh?

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:08.690
Then who did?

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.290
I'll get proof!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.530
Proof that she's a vampire.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.910
A full moon, the time
for vampires to be active.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.570
Right, let's go hunting.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:40.290
Sorry, I don't like to be followed.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.420
Miyu, what do you
plan to do with him?

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.960
He's a bit of a pain
but he doesn't matter.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.630
Isn't it about time
you thirsted for blood?

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:55.170
Say, Lava, don't you think
I have the right to choose?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.710
He's already passed the graveyard.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.680
Tell me, what did
you trick him with?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.980
He saw only what
he wanted to see.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.080
You always dodge my questions.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.960
Come on, tell me.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:13.530
Shiina, do you want
to be sealed, too?

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.460
You're mean, aren't you?

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.890
That nerd's already in the next town.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.600
Do you think the murderer
bears a grudge against them?

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.440
Even if he did, why
kill them that way?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.340
I wonder what
Yamanouchi is thinking?

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.550
She was friends with them.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:49.060
The bell has rung.
Take your seats, class.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:51.460
Miss Yanagihara, do they
know who the killer is?

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.430
I can't concentrate on class
after something like this.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.700
Investigating the case
is a job for the police!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:01.100
Do I need permission
to start my job?

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.920
You grow flowers, Miss Yanagihara.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.920
I like flowers since they
don't talk too much.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.250
I like them, too.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.720
I like how they bloom with such beauty...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.660
such innocence.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.260
What do you mean?

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.630
That's just what I think.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.660
You're a strange girl.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.460
It's me, Miss Maiko!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.770
Nobuo?

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.930
Is your house in this area?

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.730
You could have a problem!
It's about your class!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:05.930
You're in danger!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.640
I see. Please come up.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.840
You came to tell me that?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.110
This is not a laughing matter!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:18.650
You know there were teeth
marks on the dead bodies.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:22.010
That's what I heard.
But a vampire?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.780
Yamano is after you now.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.250
So we need to do something to
protect you from the vampire.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.690
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:33.100
But it's your imagination
rather than a conjecture.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:36.800
I don't know if you should suspect
your classmate based on that.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.900
Miss Maiko, you think I'm nuts!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.630
No, not at all.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.130
You're the same as my classmates.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.400
You think everything
is based on common sense.

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.180
I'll make some coffee.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.190
I figured she
didn't have a boyfriend.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.960
What girlish taste!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.100
Bad taste in pets, too.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.800
Don't judge it by how it looks.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.900
I mean, I know this kind of pet
is a new trend, though.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.640
It's my friend.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.520
It will listen to the things
I can't tell people.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:28.690
I agree.
People cannot be trusted.

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.820
But you can trust me.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.090
I'm sorry but I need
to grade assignments.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.070
The way she acted... that's not
my favorite teacher, Maiko.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.610
You'd better stay out of it now.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.050
She has a reflection!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.120
But she's a vampire...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.670
Miss Yanagihara, I
brought you a present.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.800
Thanks, but... no thanks.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.230
I'm sure you would
look great with this.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:20.270
Here.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.040
Stop it!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.280
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to...

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:31.580
That's all right.
Everybody has bad days.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:34.750
Good-bye now, Miss Maiko.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:35.780
See you.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:42.850
She doesn't like that cross.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.440
So this is the final warning.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.470
Are you serious?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.510
Do you know Eri is still...

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.450
No! I can't believe it!

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:39.350
Miss Maiko, you're just like us.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:42.250
Yamanouchi, what do you mean,
I didn't do any...

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:44.150
That's all right.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.150
See!

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.890
Everyone has the urge
to shoplift sometimes.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.330
From now on, you won't
tell on us, will you?

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.040
It was my first and last time.

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:04.240
But they weren't satisfied
with merely gagging me.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.040
They kept prodding
me over and over.

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:16.220
Well... one more person
and it'll all be over.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:23.860
Only...

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.760
One more...

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.110
You wanted me
to come here, what for?

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:51.490
So...

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:55.460
that's how you treat
our gifts, Miss Maiko?

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:59.530
I'm not like you guys.
I'll never do it again.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.200
Oh, so then you're
gonna tell on us?!

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:06.130
No, I've decided to silence you.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:20.850
This is my friend.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:24.350
He erases everything,
everything I hate.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:30.530
This woman wished that you girls
would vanish from this world.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.600
So I'll help make
her wish come true!

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.760
Y... You!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.940
You've finally shown yourself.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.570
Now you can't escape.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.940
You are... the Guardian!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:24.480
You've done a lot of bad things,
but you do not belong here.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.780
Return to the Darkness peacefully.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:31.750
You're a blood-sucking vampire.
You are one of us!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.590
Don't compare me with Shinma
who dwell in the shadows...

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.390
and prey on human weakness.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.500
Lava!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.740
Stray Shinma,
to the darkness with thee!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:36.420
Everyone's dead.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.320
It's all my fault.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:44.000
It's not your fault.
Everyone has a weak heart.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:49.090
The one to blame is the Shinma
who possessed your heart.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.830
But... I'm finished.
I don't want to live anymore!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:24.060
May you sleep well
in eternal happiness.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:37.880
Great!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.020
That was great!

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:42.280
So, you're a good vampire!
Just like in the novels!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:45.780
Let's go, Lava.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:46.550
Wait!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.360
Make me one of you!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.500
Why?

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:54.190
It's boring to live with
these pathetic humans!

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.240
I wanna punish bad people, too!

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.540
Are you that bored?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.070
You bet! That's why...

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:04.370
Everyone has to live
carrying a burden on one's back.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.000
But you don't carry anything.

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:10.080
And you enjoy judging people?

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.110
In spite of the fact
that you're human!

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.150
W... What?

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:18.480
What the heck
are you talking about?!

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:20.790
Don't follow.

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.290
Make me one of you!

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:07.100
Well, you're not bored anymore.
